ion problem or a horrifying  government-run breeding program in  zootopia Judy Hopps confronts her folks  about possessing 275 siblings which is a  big number many of these innocent  brother and sister bunnies would  undoubtedly perish if Predators could  continue to pursue prey but in zootopia  they will live a peaceful life yet  unknowingly culminating in massive  overcrowding in food shortage the one  and only method for avoiding this is for  the administration to exert control over  its citizens without becoming too  gruesome this Theory entails a large  number of animals getting transferred to  a ranch to be sacrificed fans will be  riveted to their screens if the movie  concentrates on this frightening idea  but at this same time this idea will  capture how peaceful and all-inclusive  place like zootopia can have dark  secrets and dirty Politics as well just  like the real world  so now we have heard a few possibilities  of how the plot could go on but what  does the fan community on Reddit  actually say there one theory is Prevail  namely that we will meet Dick's father  in the course of the film and the latter  will be arrested by Judy when the  interrogation reveals who it is Nick  Falls back into his old Behavior  patterns the rest of the movie will then  delve into Nick and his father's past  and find answers as to why he abandoned  him before he was even born in general  fans on Reddit are crying out to know  more about the Sly Fox  but when is zootopia 2 coming opinions  differ on this because Disney is not  even officially confirmed a second part  some years ago they probably would not  have even thought of making a sequel but  since Wreck-It Ralph and Frozen they're  considering a theatrical sequel looking  at the numbers this would only be  natural as utopia was one of the most  successful movies from the Disney  Animation Studios in the last 10 years  anyways with the recent schedule updates  from Disney's animation slate it is safe  to say that zoo